{"seq":4,"slug":"pbr-rendering","title":"PBR 渲染","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-graphics/lighting-and-shadow/pbr-rendering","wordCount":1631,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"pbr-渲染\">PBR 渲染</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>基于物理的渲染（Physically Based Rendering, PBR）是现代游戏图形的标准光照方案。PBR 遵循物理光学定律——能量守恒、微表面理论和菲涅尔效应——确保材质在任何光照条件下都呈现一致且真实的视觉效果。PBR 的关键优势在于材质参数具有物理意义，艺术家可以使用统一的工作流创建在不同环境中都表现正确的材质。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[PBR 材质系统] --&gt; B[金属度/粗糙度工作流]&#10;    A --&gt; C[镜面反射/光泽度工作流]&#10;    B --&gt; D[Albedo 贴图]&#10;    B --&gt; E[Metallic 贴图]&#10;    B --&gt; F[Roughness 贴图]&#10;    B --&gt; G[Normal 贴图]&#10;    B --&gt; H[AO 贴图]&#10;    C --&gt; I[Diffuse 贴图]&#10;    C --&gt; J[Specular 贴图]&#10;    C --&gt; K[Glossiness 贴图]\">graph TD\n    A[PBR 材质系统] --&gt; B[金属度/粗糙度工作流]\n    A --&gt; C[镜面反射/光泽度工作流]\n    B --&gt; D[Albedo 贴图]\n    B --&gt; E[Metallic 贴图]\n    B --&gt; F[Roughness 贴图]\n    B --&gt; G[Normal 贴图]\n    B --&gt; H[AO 贴图]\n    C --&gt; I[Diffuse 贴图]\n    C --&gt; J[Specular 贴图]\n    C --&gt; K[Glossiness 贴图]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工作流</th>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>使用引擎</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Metal/Roughness</td>\n<td>Albedo + Metallic + Roughness</td>\n<td>参数直觉、不易出错</td>\n<td>UE5, Unity HDRP, Godot</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Specular/Glossiness</td>\n<td>Diffuse + Specular + Glossiness</td>\n<td>更精细的反射控制</td>\n<td>Unity Built-in, 部分引擎</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>金属度/粗糙度（Metal/Roughness）工作流是当前的行业标准。金属度（Metallic）是二值参数：金属（1.0）或非金属（0.0），中间值仅用于过渡区域。粗糙度（Roughness）控制表面微表面的起伏程度，从完美镜面（0.0）到完全粗糙（1.0）。</p>\n<p>PBR 的两大基础原则是：能量守恒——物体反射的光不会超过接收的光；以及微表面模型——表面由无数朝向各异的微镜面组成，粗糙度决定了微面法线的分散程度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"pbr-材质纹理工作流\">PBR 材质纹理工作流</h2><p>PBR 材质由一组纹理贴图定义，每张贴图存储不同的物理属性。这些贴图的正确制作是 PBR 效果的基础。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>贴图类型</th>\n<th>颜色空间</th>\n<th>通道</th>\n<th>典型格式</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Albedo/Base Color</td>\n<td>sRGB</td>\n<td>RGB</td>\n<td>RGBA8</td>\n<td>表面固有颜色，不含光照信息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Metallic</td>\n<td>Linear</td>\n<td>单通道</td>\n<td>R8</td>\n<td>金属度，通常 0 或 1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Roughness</td>\n<td>Linear</td>\n<td>单通道</td>\n<td>R8</td>\n<td>微表面粗糙度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Normal</td>\n<td>Linear</td>\n<td>RGB</td>\n<td>RGB8</td>\n<td>切线空间法线偏移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AO</td>\n<td>Linear</td>\n<td>单通道</td>\n<td>R8</td>\n<td>环境遮蔽（预烘焙）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Emissive</td>\n<td>sRGB</td>\n<td>RGB</td>\n<td>RGB8/RGB16F</td>\n<td>自发光颜色和强度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Height/Displacement</td>\n<td>Linear</td>\n<td>单通道</td>\n<td>R16</td>\n<td>表面高度用于视差映射</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>在实际项目中，多个单通道贴图通常打包到一张纹理的不同通道中以减少纹理采样次数。常见的打包方式是 ORM 贴图：R 通道存储 AO，G 通道存储 Roughness，B 通道存储 Metallic。</p>\n<p>Albedo 贴图的制作要求是不包含任何光照信息（无阴影、无高光、无 AO），只有材质固有的漫反射颜色。对于非金属材质，Albedo 值通常在 50-240 sRGB 范围内（过暗或过亮都不物理）；对于金属材质，Albedo 表示的是反射颜色（如金色、铜色），其亮度通常在 180-255 sRGB 范围。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface PBRMaterial {&#10;  albedoMap: GPUTexture;&#10;  normalMap: GPUTexture;&#10;  ormMap: GPUTexture;&#10;  emissiveMap: GPUTexture | null;&#10;  albedoFactor: [number, number, number, number];&#10;  metallicFactor: number;&#10;  roughnessFactor: number;&#10;  emissiveFactor: [number, number, number];&#10;}&#10;&#10;function createPBRBindGroup(&#10;  device: GPUDevice,&#10;  layout: GPUBindGroupLayout,&#10;  material: PBRMaterial,&#10;  sampler: GPUSampler,&#10;): GPUBindGroup {&#10;  const entries: GPUBindGroupEntry[] = [&#10;    { binding: 0, resource: sampler },&#10;    { binding: 1, resource: material.albedoMap.createView() },&#10;    { binding: 2, resource: material.normalMap.createView() },&#10;    { binding: 3, resource: material.ormMap.createView() },&#10;  ];&#10;&#10;  if (material.emissiveMap) {&#10;    entries.push({ binding: 4, resource: material.emissiveMap.createView() });&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return device.createBindGroup({ layout, entries });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PBRMaterial</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  albedoMap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GPUTexture</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  normalMap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GPUTexture</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  ormMap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GPUTexture</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  emissiveMap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GPUTexture</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  albedoFactor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  metallicFactor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  roughnessFactor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  emissiveFactor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createPBRBindGroup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  device</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GPUDevice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  layout</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GPUBindGroupLayout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  material</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PBRMaterial</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  sampler</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GPUSampler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GPUBindGroup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> entries</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GPUBindGroupEntry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { binding: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, resource: sampler },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { binding: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, resource: material.albedoMap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { binding: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, resource: material.normalMap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { binding: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, resource: material.ormMap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (material.emissiveMap) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    entries.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ binding: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, resource: material.emissiveMap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> device.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createBindGroup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ layout, entries });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"图像基础光照\">图像基础光照</h2><p>图像基础光照（Image-Based Lighting, IBL）使用环境贴图作为光源，为 PBR 材质提供来自所有方向的间接光照。IBL 是 PBR 渲染不可或缺的组成部分，没有 IBL 的 PBR 材质在暗角处会显得不自然地黑暗。</p>\n<p>IBL 分为漫反射和镜面反射两部分：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[HDR 环境贴图] --&gt; B[预处理]&#10;    B --&gt; C[辐照度贴图]&#10;    B --&gt; D[预过滤环境贴图]&#10;    B --&gt; E[BRDF LUT]&#10;    C --&gt; F[漫反射 IBL]&#10;    D --&gt; G[镜面反射 IBL]&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; H[最终间接光照]&#10;    G --&gt; H\">graph LR\n    A[HDR 环境贴图] --&gt; B[预处理]\n    B --&gt; C[辐照度贴图]\n    B --&gt; D[预过滤环境贴图]\n    B --&gt; E[BRDF LUT]\n    C --&gt; F[漫反射 IBL]\n    D --&gt; G[镜面反射 IBL]\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; H[最终间接光照]\n    G --&gt; H</pre><p>漫反射 IBL 使用辐照度贴图（Irradiance Map），它是环境贴图在半球上积分的结果，可以预计算为低分辨率立方体贴图（32×32 足够）。镜面反射 IBL 使用预过滤环境贴图（Pre-filtered Environment Map），不同的 Mipmap 级别对应不同的粗糙度。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"glsl\" data-code=\"#version 450&#10;&#10;layout(set = 0, binding = 0) uniform samplerCube irradianceMap;&#10;layout(set = 0, binding = 1) uniform samplerCube prefilteredMap;&#10;layout(set = 0, binding = 2) uniform sampler2D brdfLUT;&#10;&#10;vec3 fresnelSchlickRoughness(float cosTheta, vec3 F0, float roughness) {&#10;    return F0 + (max(vec3(1.0 - roughness), F0) - F0) * pow(clamp(1.0 - cosTheta, 0.0, 1.0), 5.0);&#10;}&#10;&#10;vec3 calculateIBL(vec3 N, vec3 V, vec3 albedo, float metallic, float roughness, float ao) {&#10;    vec3 F0 = mix(vec3(0.04), albedo, metallic);&#10;    float NdotV = max(dot(N, V), 0.0);&#10;    vec3 F = fresnelSchlickRoughness(NdotV, F0, roughness);&#10;&#10;    vec3 kD = (1.0 - F) * (1.0 - metallic);&#10;    vec3 irradiance = texture(irradianceMap, N).rgb;&#10;    vec3 diffuseIBL = kD * irradiance * albedo;&#10;&#10;    vec3 R = reflect(-V, N);&#10;    float maxLod = textureQueryLevels(prefilteredMap) - 1.0;&#10;    vec3 prefilteredColor = textureLod(prefilteredMap, R, roughness * maxLod).rgb;&#10;    vec2 brdf = texture(brdfLUT, vec2(NdotV, roughness)).rg;&#10;    vec3 specularIBL = prefilteredColor * (F * brdf.x + brdf.y);&#10;&#10;    return (diffuseIBL + specularIBL) * ao;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#version 450</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(set = 0, binding = 0) uniform samplerCube irradianceMap;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(set = 0, binding = 1) uniform samplerCube prefilteredMap;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(set = 0, binding = 2) uniform sampler2D brdfLUT;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>vec3 fresnelSchlickRoughness(float cosTheta, vec3 F0, float roughness) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return F0 + (max(vec3(1.0 - roughness), F0) - F0) * pow(clamp(1.0 - cosTheta, 0.0, 1.0), 5.0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>vec3 calculateIBL(vec3 N, vec3 V, vec3 albedo, float metallic, float roughness, float ao) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 F0 = mix(vec3(0.04), albedo, metallic);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float NdotV = max(dot(N, V), 0.0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 F = fresnelSchlickRoughness(NdotV, F0, roughness);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 kD = (1.0 - F) * (1.0 - metallic);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 irradiance = texture(irradianceMap, N).rgb;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 diffuseIBL = kD * irradiance * albedo;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 R = reflect(-V, N);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float maxLod = textureQueryLevels(prefilteredMap) - 1.0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 prefilteredColor = textureLod(prefilteredMap, R, roughness * maxLod).rgb;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec2 brdf = texture(brdfLUT, vec2(NdotV, roughness)).rg;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 specularIBL = prefilteredColor * (F * brdf.x + brdf.y);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return (diffuseIBL + specularIBL) * ao;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>BRDF 查找表（BRDF LUT）是预计算的二维纹理，横轴为 NdotV，纵轴为粗糙度。它存储了 Split-Sum 近似中的镜面反射积分缩放因子和偏移因子，避免了运行时昂贵的半球积分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"高级-pbr-特性\">高级 PBR 特性</h2><p>标准的金属度/粗糙度工作流覆盖了大部分常见材质，但某些特殊材质需要额外的参数和计算。</p>\n<p>透明涂层（Clear Coat）模拟汽车漆面、木地板清漆等具有双层反射的材质。底层有自己的粗糙度和颜色，上面覆盖一层光滑的透明层：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>高级特性</th>\n<th>额外参数</th>\n<th>适用材质</th>\n<th>性能开销</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Clear Coat</td>\n<td>涂层厚度、涂层粗糙度</td>\n<td>汽车漆、清漆木材</td>\n<td>+1 次 BRDF</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>次表面散射</td>\n<td>散射颜色、散射距离</td>\n<td>皮肤、蜡烛、大理石</td>\n<td>中到高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>各向异性</td>\n<td>各向异性方向、强度</td>\n<td>拉丝金属、头发</td>\n<td>+切线计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>虹彩</td>\n<td>薄膜厚度</td>\n<td>肥皂泡、油膜</td>\n<td>查找表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>织物</td>\n<td>光泽、绒毛方向</td>\n<td>布料、天鹅绒</td>\n<td>替换 BRDF</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>次表面散射（Subsurface Scattering, SSS）模拟光线穿透半透明材质后在内部多次散射的效果。实时 SSS 常用屏幕空间模糊（Screen-Space Blur）或预积分散射轮廓（Pre-Integrated SSS Profile）来近似：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"glsl\" data-code=\"vec3 calculateSSS(vec3 N, vec3 L, vec3 V, vec3 albedo, vec3 scatterColor, float scatterWidth) {&#10;    float NdotL = dot(N, L);&#10;    float wrapDiffuse = max(0.0, (NdotL + scatterWidth) / (1.0 + scatterWidth));&#10;    vec3 scatter = scatterColor * wrapDiffuse;&#10;&#10;    vec3 H = normalize(L + N * 0.6);&#10;    float VdotH = pow(clamp(dot(V, -H), 0.0, 1.0), 3.0);&#10;    vec3 backlight = albedo * VdotH * scatterColor;&#10;&#10;    return scatter + backlight;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>vec3 calculateSSS(vec3 N, vec3 L, vec3 V, vec3 albedo, vec3 scatterColor, float scatterWidth) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float NdotL = dot(N, L);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float wrapDiffuse = max(0.0, (NdotL + scatterWidth) / (1.0 + scatterWidth));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 scatter = scatterColor * wrapDiffuse;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 H = normalize(L + N * 0.6);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float VdotH = pow(clamp(dot(V, -H), 0.0, 1.0), 3.0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 backlight = albedo * VdotH * scatterColor;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return scatter + backlight;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>各向异性反射（Anisotropic Reflection）出现在具有微观方向性纹理的材质上，如拉丝金属、唱片表面和头发。GGX 各向异性 NDF 使用两个独立的粗糙度参数控制切线和副切线方向的高光拉伸。</p>\n<h2 id=\"色调映射与颜色管理\">色调映射与颜色管理</h2><p>PBR 渲染在线性 HDR 颜色空间中计算光照，最终需要通过色调映射（Tone Mapping）压缩到 LDR 范围并进行 Gamma 校正后输出到显示器。色调映射的选择直接影响画面的整体氛围和色彩风格。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[HDR 线性颜色] --&gt; B[色调映射]&#10;    B --&gt; C[LDR 线性颜色]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Gamma 校正]&#10;    D --&gt; E[sRGB 输出]\">graph LR\n    A[HDR 线性颜色] --&gt; B[色调映射]\n    B --&gt; C[LDR 线性颜色]\n    C --&gt; D[Gamma 校正]\n    D --&gt; E[sRGB 输出]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>色调映射算子</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>应用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Reinhard</td>\n<td>简单均匀压缩</td>\n<td>原型开发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ACES Filmic</td>\n<td>电影色彩风格</td>\n<td>AAA 游戏标准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Uncharted 2</td>\n<td>高对比度保留</td>\n<td>动作游戏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AgX</td>\n<td>更好的色彩保真度</td>\n<td>新一代引擎</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Khronos PBR Neutral</td>\n<td>中性色彩映射</td>\n<td>glTF 标准</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>ACES（Academy Color Encoding System）是目前游戏行业最常用的色调映射曲线，提供电影级的色彩风格：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"glsl\" data-code=\"vec3 acesFilm(vec3 x) {&#10;    float a = 2.51;&#10;    float b = 0.03;&#10;    float c = 2.43;&#10;    float d = 0.59;&#10;    float e = 0.14;&#10;    return clamp((x * (a * x + b)) / (x * (c * x + d) + e), 0.0, 1.0);&#10;}&#10;&#10;vec3 linearToSRGB(vec3 color) {&#10;    return pow(color, vec3(1.0 / 2.2));&#10;}&#10;&#10;vec3 finalOutput(vec3 hdrColor) {&#10;    vec3 mapped = acesFilm(hdrColor);&#10;    return linearToSRGB(mapped);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>vec3 acesFilm(vec3 x) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float a = 2.51;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float b = 0.03;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float c = 2.43;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float d = 0.59;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float e = 0.14;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return clamp((x * (a * x + b)) / (x * (c * x + d) + e), 0.0, 1.0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>vec3 linearToSRGB(vec3 color) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return pow(color, vec3(1.0 / 2.2));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>vec3 finalOutput(vec3 hdrColor) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 mapped = acesFilm(hdrColor);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return linearToSRGB(mapped);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>正确的颜色管理要求整个渲染管线保持一致：Albedo 纹理从 sRGB 解码到线性空间、所有光照计算在线性空间进行、色调映射后编码回 sRGB。混淆颜色空间是 PBR 实现中最常见的错误之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((PBR 渲染))&#10;    材质工作流&#10;      金属度/粗糙度&#10;      ORM 通道打包&#10;      Albedo 规范&#10;    IBL 间接光&#10;      辐照度贴图&#10;      预过滤环境贴图&#10;      BRDF LUT&#10;    高级特性&#10;      Clear Coat&#10;      次表面散射&#10;      各向异性&#10;    颜色管理&#10;      线性空间计算&#10;      ACES 色调映射&#10;      sRGB 输出\">mindmap\n  root((PBR 渲染))\n    材质工作流\n      金属度/粗糙度\n      ORM 通道打包\n      Albedo 规范\n    IBL 间接光\n      辐照度贴图\n      预过滤环境贴图\n      BRDF LUT\n    高级特性\n      Clear Coat\n      次表面散射\n      各向异性\n    颜色管理\n      线性空间计算\n      ACES 色调映射\n      sRGB 输出</pre><ul>\n<li>PBR 基于能量守恒和微表面理论，材质参数具有物理意义，确保跨场景的一致性</li>\n<li>金属度/粗糙度工作流是行业标准，ORM 通道打包减少纹理采样次数</li>\n<li>IBL 为 PBR 提供不可或缺的间接光照，辐照度贴图和预过滤环境贴图可高效预计算</li>\n<li>BRDF LUT 通过 Split-Sum 近似避免了运行时的昂贵半球积分</li>\n<li>Clear Coat、SSS、各向异性等高级特性扩展了标准 PBR 的材质表现力</li>\n<li>整个管线必须在线性颜色空间中计算光照，通过 ACES 等色调映射输出到显示器</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"PBR 渲染","id":"pbr-渲染"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"PBR 材质纹理工作流","id":"pbr-材质纹理工作流"},{"level":2,"text":"图像基础光照","id":"图像基础光照"},{"level":2,"text":"高级 PBR 特性","id":"高级-pbr-特性"},{"level":2,"text":"色调映射与颜色管理","id":"色调映射与颜色管理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"全局光照","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-graphics/lighting-and-shadow/global-illumination"},"next":{"title":"后处理管线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-graphics/post-processing/post-processing-pipeline"}}